# Seconda fotografia ternaria: F | Ru | Rm.
#
# I fatti restano interi mentre il lato delle regole viene diviso. Le tre
# domande coprono i due bordi esterni e il cross interno fra tipi di regola:
#
#   F <-> Ru   planet_order(mercury, 1) -> planet(mercury)
#   F <-> Rm   planet_order + rocky_world -> terrestrial(mercury)
#   Ru <-> Rm  planet_order -> planet, composto con supports_life -> habitable

[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!set PARROT0_TOOLS=1
!reset

[test whole facts cross one-premise rules]
!timeout 12
> is mercury a planet?
< Yes.

[test whole facts cross multi-premise rules]
> is mercury terrestrial?
< Yes.

[test one-premise and multi-premise rules cross internally through facts]
> is earth habitable?
< Yes.
